--!strict
--[[
    Kontra ESP  (v2)

    Player overlay for "[JUGGERNAUT] Kontra" (place 87204735676240).

    It reads only. No remote calls, no writes to Lighting / Camera / parts.

    What it shows
      * A box, name, distance and health bar for every character the game
        currently replicates.
      * A dim "last seen" marker for a few seconds after the game hides a
        target again. This exists because Kontra streams only the characters
        you are allowed to see; hidden players are parked a million studs away
        and never sent to the client at all.

    Controls
      RightShift   - overlay on / off
      RightControl - settings panel on / off
      Panel rows   - click a row to flip it (number rows cycle on click)
      Stop         - getgenv().KontraESP.Destroy()

    Settings are saved to "kontra_esp_settings.txt" when writefile exists.
]]

